      "text": "3. Match\na. repeats in books: Duplicate\nb. same GSTIN and invoice:\n   within Rs 1 per tax head\n   or 5% band: Matched or Check\nc. same PAN, fuzzy score 90+:\n   Check (branch)\nd. leftovers: Missing",
